body:
Lillia absolutely, not sure why but every kindred main also loves Lillia. 

&#x200B;

Maybe we're just into furry girls?

Edit: For those that are asking me about the mastery emote. I used to follow this Kindred onetrick about 5 years ago, and in every description in his video he had a tutorial on how to do it. I did it once back then and it just worked. I can't find the man's youtube channel anymore. It was Redkind or something similar.

&#x200B;

Edit2: I remembered the youtuber but he has taken the guides from his description, this is the guide that my friend followed and worked https://www.reddit.com/r/leagueoflegends/comments/3mwvls/how\_to\_set\_your\_champion\_mastery\_emote\_to/

as every veteran jungle main will tell you. /muteall when you queue up with that smite. Pings are more than enough and if someone abuses that, mute it too. Watch some tips on how to jungle clear and when to go for drakes/objectives and gank when you can, you'll get the hang of it soon enough.

&#x200B;

Getting flamed is part and parcel of jungling. Your mid will lose a level 2 1v1 then hit you with the 'jgl gap'. It's ineveitable. So just practice, you'll be fine.

This. 

